      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        150.0059051513672,
        108.74749755859375,
        315.394287109375,
        137.64349365234375
      ],
      "text": "A ,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        169.03790283203125,
        115.61629486083984,
        445.2731018066406,
        135.84349060058594
      ],
      "text": "dministering reading and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 16.799999237060547,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.24259948730469,
        143.21633911132812,
        479.0123291015625,
        163.4435272216797
      ],
      "text": "interpreting a tuberculin skin test",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 16.799999237060547,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        191.27099609375,
        513.403076171875,
        204.62249755859375
      ],
      "text": "This annex gives information on administering, reading and interpreting a tuberculin",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        207.26751708984375,
        155.32742309570312,
        220.6190185546875
      ],
      "text": "skin test (TST).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        231.77398681640625,
        513.4834594726562,
        245.12548828125
      ],
      "text": "A TST is the intradermal injection of a combination of mycobacterial antigens that elicit",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        247.7705078125,
        513.3914184570312,
        261.12200927734375
      ],
      "text": "an immune response (delayed-type hypersensitivity), represented by induration, which",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        263.76702880859375,
        243.07235717773438,
        277.1185302734375
      ],
      "text": "can be measured in millimetres.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        288.2044982910156,
        513.4835815429688,
        301.625
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis The standard method of identifying people infected with M.   is the TST using",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        304.27001953125,
        513.3916015625,
        317.62152099609375
      ],
      "text": "the Mantoux method. Multiple puncture tests should not be used as these tests are",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        320.2665100097656,
        513.4376220703125,
        333.6180114746094
      ],
      "text": "unreliable (because the amount of tuberculin injected intradermally cannot be precisely",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        336.26300048828125,
        143.6204071044922,
        349.614501953125
      ],
      "text": "controlled).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        360.7695007324219,
        513.3570556640625,
        374.1210021972656
      ],
      "text": "This annex describes how to administer, read and interpret a TST using 5 tuberculin units",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        376.7659912109375,
        513.345458984375,
        390.11749267578125
      ],
      "text": "(TU) of tuberculin PPD-S. An alternative to 5 TU of tuberculin PPD-S is 2 TU of tuberculin",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        392.7624816894531,
        138.80189514160156,
        406.1139831542969
      ],
      "text": "PPD RT 23.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        419.7732238769531,
        183.82339477539062,
        436.36322021484375
      ],
      "text": "Administration",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        446.4272155761719,
        449.23297119140625,
        461.043701171875
      ],
      "text": "1.\t  Locate and clean injection site 5–10 cm (2–4 inches) below elbow joint",
      "font": "Calibri",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        469.0367126464844,
        344.25250244140625,
        482.3882141113281
      ],
      "text": "Place forearm palm-up on a firm, well-lit surface.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        472.7086181640625,
        91.36740112304688,
        480.7086181640625
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        491.0367126464844,
        481.6890869140625,
        504.3882141113281
      ],
      "text": "Select an area free of barriers (e.g. scars, sores, veins) to placing and reading.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        494.7086181640625,
        91.36740112304688,
        502.7086181640625
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        513.0366821289062,
        286.7984924316406,
        526.38818359375
      ],
      "text": "Clean the area with an alcohol swab.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        516.7085571289062,
        91.36740112304688,
        524.7085571289062
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        540.014404296875,
        179.6318817138672,
        555.9864501953125
      ],
      "text": "2.\t  Prepare syringe",
      "font": "ArialMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        563.2793579101562,
        502.5615539550781,
        576.630859375
      ],
      "text": "Check expiry date on vial and ensure vial contains tuberculin PPD-S (5 TU/0.1 ml).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        566.9512329101562,
        91.36740112304688,
        574.9512329101562
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        585.279296875,
        513.41748046875,
        598.6307983398438
      ],
      "text": "Use a single-dose tuberculin syringe with a short (¼- to ½-inch) 27-gauge needle",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        588.951171875,
        91.36740112304688,
        596.951171875
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        601.2758178710938,
        195.614990234375,
        614.6273193359375
      ],
      "text": "with a short bevel.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        623.2792358398438,
        321.4940185546875,
        636.6307373046875
      ],
      "text": "Clean the top of the vial with a sterile swab.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        626.9511108398438,
        91.36740112304688,
        634.9511108398438
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        645.2792358398438,
        289.3285217285156,
        658.6307373046875
      ],
      "text": "Fill the syringe with 0.1 ml tuberculin.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        648.9511108398438,
        91.36740112304688,
        656.9511108398438
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        672.2569580078125,
        268.7527160644531,
        688.22900390625
      ],
      "text": "3.\t  Inject tuberculin (see Figure A3.1)",
      "font": "ArialMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        695.8524780273438,
        377.4645690917969,
        709.2039794921875
      ],
      "text": "Insert the needle slowly, bevel up, at an angle of 5–15°.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        699.5243530273438,
        91.36740112304688,
        707.5243530273438
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        717.8525390625,
        368.79351806640625,
        731.2040405273438
      ],
      "text": "Needle bevel should be visible just below skin surface.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        721.5244140625,
        91.36740112304688,
        729.5244140625
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04249572753906,
        742.9225463867188,
        199.43296813964844,
        756.343017578125
      ],
      "text": "4.\t Check injection site",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        770.32958984375,
        513.4749755859375,
        783.6810913085938
      ],
      "text": "After injection, a flat intradermal wheal of 8–10 mm diameter should appear. If not,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        774.00146484375,
        91.36740112304688,
        782.00146484375
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        786.3261108398438,
        494.2124938964844,
        799.6776123046875
      ],
      "text": "repeat the injection at a site at least 5 cm (2 inches) away from the original site.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        553.0839233398438,
        805.8439331054688,
        586.4439086914062,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "115",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}